  "description": "Goh Wun is back from the brink of death, but the man who loved him is gone. Waking up with total amnesia, Wun finds that his only lifeline is Kwon Hui-Jae: a guide who looks at him with equal parts longing and loathing. As they navigate a dangerous web of secrets and supernatural stakes, Wun realizes that forgetting the past didn't make the pain go away. He still has his powers, and he still wants Huijae. But in this game of redemption, the truth might be more dangerous than the loss of memory itself.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
